## Regression Risk Containment

### At-Risk Code Areas

| Area | Risk | Containment Strategy |
|------|------|---------------------|
| `data/catalogue.ts` | unrollDescendantKeys change affects all category queries | Write unit tests first, verify before/after behavior |
| `app/components/layout/catalogue/` | Navigation depends on VFS structure | Verify navigation still renders correctly post-fix |
| `app/(store)/products/[...category]/page.tsx` | Already fixed, don't touch | Mark as frozen, no edits |
| Hero component | User modified recently | Verify no regression in hero display |

### Pre-Sprint Regression Tests (MUST PASS before any changes)

```typescript
// tests/vfs/regression-pre-sprint.test.ts
describe("Pre-Sprint Regression Baseline", () => {
  it("catalogue-index.json has all leaf nodes in slotMetadataMap", () => {
    const leafIds = ["o7c6baiuobsr7ni2y2vf22sh", "yq3p9s798zszjkzm5btnebjh"];
    leafIds.forEach(id => {
      expect(catalogueIndex.slotMetadataMap[id]).toBeDefined();
    });
  });

  it("navigation generates correct URLs", () => {
    const nav = getCatalogueForNavigation();
    const headphones = nav.find(n => n.label === "Headphones");
    const byDesign = headphones?.sections.find(s => s.title === "By Design");
    const openBack = byDesign?.links.find(l => l.label === "Open-Back");
    // Currently broken: returns /shop/open-back, should be /products/headphones/open-back
    expect(openBack?.url).toMatch(/\/products\/headphones\/open-back/);
  });

  it("resolveSlugToId resolves leaf slugs correctly", () => {
    expect(resolveSlugToId("open-back")).toBe("o7c6baiuobsr7ni2y2vf22sh");
    expect(resolveSlugToId("closed-back")).toBe("yq3p9s798zszjkzm5btnebjh");
  });
});
```

