**Objective**: Verify and fix `unrollDescendantKeys` to correctly handle all node types.

**DoD Layer 1 - Structure (Test First):**
- [ ] Write unit test: `unrollDescendantKeys(leafId)` returns `[leafId]`
- [ ] Write unit test: `unrollDescendantKeys(headerId)` returns `[headerId, ...descendants]`
