### Scope Contract 2: URL Path Correction

**Objective**: Fix navigation URL generation to match actual Next.js route structure.

**Current (Broken):**
```typescript
// data/catalogue.ts:163
url: `/shop/${rootItem.slug?.current}/${link.slug?.current}`
// Results in: /shop/open-back
```

**Target (Fixed):**
```typescript
url: `/products/${rootItem.slug?.current}/${link.slug?.current}`
// Results in: /products/headphones/open-back
```

**DoD Layer 1 - Structure (Locate All Occurrences):**
