- [ ] Identify all locations building catalogue URLs
- [ ] Document each location and its purpose

**DoD Layer 2 - Layout (Fix Implementation):**
- [ ] Change `getCatalogueForNavigation()` to use `/products/` prefix
- [ ] Verify slotMetadataMap URL generation (may be separate issue)
- [ ] Check if breadcrumbs or other components hardcode paths

**DoD Layer 3 - Surface (Verification):**
- [ ] Run navigation regression tests
- [ ] Manual: Hover catalogue links, verify URL preview
- [ ] Manual: Click link, verify navigation without 404
- [ ] Verify page.tsx receives correct category params

**DoD Layer 4 - Interaction (Complete Flow):**
