## Definition of Sprint Complete

**MVP Criteria:**
1. ✅ Catalogue navigation links use correct `/products/` URLs
2. ✅ Clicking any leaf category shows correct products
3. ✅ No console errors or warnings
4. ✅ No regressions in homepage or navigation
5. ✅ All regression tests pass

**Post-Sprint Actions:**
- [ ] Run full test suite: `npm run test:all`
- [ ] Build production: `npm run build`
- [ ] Verify build succeeds without errors
- [ ] Update _MASTER_TASKLIST.todo to mark complete
- [ ] Move sprint file to _project-done/

