## Out of Scope (DO NOT TOUCH)

1. **Homepage Performance** - Hero image optimization is separate concern
2. **Homepage Visual Bugs** - Carousel, layout issues not related to VFS
3. **Product Card UI** - No redesign or styling changes
4. **Filter/Sort Logic** - Existing functionality frozen
5. **Design System** - No tailwind.config.ts changes
6. **Sanity Schema** - No CMS changes
7. **Build Pipeline** - No CI/CD changes

**Enforcement Rule**: If a fix requires touching any OOS file, stop and escalate.

