## Risk Mitigation

| Risk | Likelihood | Impact | Mitigation |
|------|------------|--------|------------|
| slotMetadataMap actually missing nodes | Low | High | Run build script, verify output before sprint |
| URL change breaks breadcrumbs | Medium | Medium | Check breadcrumb component uses same path logic |
| Fix introduces navigation regression | Medium | High | Comprehensive manual testing of drawer |
| Build script validation fails | Low | High | Fix build script as part of sprint if needed |

