## Notes & Discoveries

**Initial Observation**: The build script appears to already include leaf nodes in slotMetadataMap (verified in current catalogue-index.json). The actual bug may be:
1. URL path mismatch between navigation and routes
2. unrollDescendantKeys logic edge case
3. Stale catalogue-index.json needing rebuild

**First Action**: Run `node scripts/build-catalogue-index.mjs` to ensure data is current, then verify behavior.
